  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/395/14/obsidian_equipment.png\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UVGJGyqbv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/993245467162972220?color=blue&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=plastic&amp;logo=discord\" width=\"191\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/exlinegames/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Curseforge-Projects-blue?style=plastic&amp;logo=curseforge\" width=\"226\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fexline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Profle-blue?style=plastic&amp;logo=modrinth\" width=\"185\" height=\"28\"></a></span></strong></span></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>黑曜石裝備</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">黑曜石可以像其他礦石一樣熔煉成黑曜石錠。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用黑曜石錠像其他礦石一樣製作盔甲和工具。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">耐久度 - 1796<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">效率 - 8.5</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻擊傷害 - 6.5</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔能力 - 12</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">護甲值 - 35 (3,6,7,3)<br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">護甲附魔能力 - 5</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">馬鎧護甲值 - 10<br></span></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這曾經是我特殊盔甲和工具模組的一部分，但現在是獨立模組。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">當使用我的另一個模組「戰鎚」時，這仍然會解鎖黑曜石戰鎚。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此外，當使用我的鑰刃模組時，還有一個額外的黑曜石鑰刃配方。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">下載</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/408/905/forgeicon.png\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Forge 版本 - <span style=\"color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-equipment/files/4519276\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.19.4</a>, <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-equipment/files/3843095\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\">1</span>.19</a>, <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-equipment/files/3724960\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.18.2</a>, <a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-equipment/files/3551016\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#00f\">1.</span>18</a></span>, <span style=\"color:#00f\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-equipment/files/3403470\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.17.1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-equipment/files/3918490\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.16.5</a></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"